ally reproducible in 4.5.1.stable.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9636) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700H (20 threads) - 15.69 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nNoticed this when working on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118577.\n\nRelated: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119645, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/74236\n\n- When only selecting the root node of an inherited scene (which is a scene instance node), the \"Rename\" button is missing.\n  - It can be renamed by (double) left-clicking it as usual. It should be rename-able, given that its name text is white rather than yellow.\n- When the section includes a scene root, the \"Batch Rename\" button is missing.\n- When selecting a mix of child nodes, scene instances, and editable children, \"Rename\" and \"Batch Rename\" are sometimes incorrectly shown.\n\nI can open a PR if confirmed.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new scene and save as `test.tscn`.\n2. Right-click `test.tscn` in `FileSystem` tab, click \"New Inherited Scene\", then save as `test_inherited.tscn`.\n3. In the inherited scene, (double) left-click the root node to rename the root node.\n4. Right-click the root node, and see that the \"Rename\" button is missing in the context menu.\n\nScreenshots:\n\n<img width=\"380\" height=\"405\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/171940af-4967-4488-95d6-f70eb070a94a\" />\n\n<img width=\"379\" height=\"404\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/caab932d-830c-4941-a355-d28b07b389bc\" />\n\n<img width=\"380\" height=\"404\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0514337e-6c96-4a47-a36b-e3f4e2fed043\" />\n\n<img width=\"379\" height=\"403\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/81e43326-00c8-44c9-8283-4bbcc5ad9f8e\" />\n\n<img width=\"380\" height=\"402\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/059b539b-6787-48bb-90ba-7a103d0e7f29\" />\n\n<img width=\"380\" height=\"404\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7c51c38e-944a-4f84-bbd6-c6d1b6911ae4\" />\n\n<img width=\"379\" height=\"403\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/47f7a9f7-7b58-4feb-996c-00875605e646\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP_Rename_Button.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28040223/MRP_Rename_Button.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119593/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119593/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}